    "title": "Toledo family searching for stolen Team USA karate uniform after car theft - NewsBreak",
    "text": "3 hours ago TOLEDO, Ohio — A Toledo family is asking for help finding a stolen Team USA karate uniform after their SUV was taken from their driveway earlier this week. 16-year-old Isaiah Richards recently represented Team USA at an international karate competition in New York, a dream that took years of training and dedication to achieve. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
